 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Of course. Is there a particular day you have in mind? Then Saturday or a Saturday after a long weekend is probably ideal. Many schools have half days then. cut them into smaller pieces so they dry out faster. A bag gets heavy with wet grapes, and little hands get cold. Invite two or three neighbour families too, and think about a torch relay, an icy slide, and some simple games like musical chairs with only two chairs per child. Keep it simple so you don't overwhelm yourself. Definitely. And a small pot of warm juice. Lemon and orange juice are popular.",
